╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

for y in rect.y .. < rect.bottom
    for x in rect.x .. < rect.right
        do use canvas
            canvas.background = color-at(x, rect)
            canvas.fill(Rect(x, y, 1, 1))

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
_ color-at RGBA
    - x Coord
    - rect Rect

RGBA(red, green, blue)

.. red = start.red * inverse + end.red * ratio
.. green = start.green * inverse + end.green * ratio
.. blue = start.blue * inverse + end.blue * ratio
.. inverse = 1 - ratio
.. ratio = ((x - rect.x) as Float) / ((width - 1) as Float)
.. width = if rect.width > 1 then rect.width else 2

