+ odd BackgroundColor

────────────────────
+ This
    - even
    - odd

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

for y in rect.y .. < rect.bottom
    for x in rect.x .. < rect.right
        do use canvas
            canvas.background =
                |? checker-is-even(x, y, rect)
                    even
                ??
                    odd
            canvas.fill(Rect(x, y, 1, 1))

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
_ checker-is-even
    - x Coord
    - y Coord
    - rect Rect

((x - rect.x) / 2 + y - rect.y) % 2 == 0

