+ RibbonBackground is Painter

+ base RGBA
+ stripe RGBA

────────────────────
+ This
    - base
    - stripe

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

do use canvas
    canvas.background = base
    canvas.fill(rect)

for y in rect.y .. < rect.bottom
    for x in rect.x .. < rect.right
        if is-ribbon(x, y, rect)
            do use canvas
                canvas.background = stripe
                canvas.fill(Rect(x, y, 1, 1))

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
_ is-ribbon
    - x Coord
    - y Coord
    - rect Rect

((x - rect.x) + (y - rect.y) * 2) % 9 < 3

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SpectrumBackground is Painter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

for y in rect.y .. < rect.bottom
    for x in rect.x .. < rect.right
        do use canvas
            canvas.background = spectrum-color(x, y, rect)
            canvas.fill(Rect(x, y, 1, 1))

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
_ spectrum-color HSVA
    - x Coord
    - y Coord
    - rect Rect

HSVA(hue, saturation, value)

.. hue = ((x - rect.x) as Float) / ((width - 1) as Float)
.. saturation = 0.72 + y-ratio * 0.24
.. value = 0.82 - y-ratio * 0.24
.. y-ratio = ((y - rect.y) as Float) / ((height - 1) as Float)
.. width = if rect.width > 1 then rect.width else 2
.. height = if rect.height > 1 then rect.height else 2

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ background-profile-frame-count Int

Int(env("YUMI_BACKGROUND_PROFILE_FRAMES") ?? "0")
